WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.575
The command network is fragmented across the islands.

00:00:04.575 --> 00:00:13.700
Obsidian Directorate forces hold the approaches, and the water gate is the only practical route for your amphibious vehicles.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:21.000
Restore the network, secure the crossing, and combine reconnaissance, missiles, aircraft, and ships.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.250
Every restored link makes the next move possible.
